#### ordinary identifier names are not refused by the validator

#### passes a plain identifier through savepoint and release

- Verify: passes a plain identifier through savepoint and release


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 9 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: passes a plain identifier through savepoint and release")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
var db = Database.memory()?
var tx = db.begin()?
val sp = _rejected_by_validator(tx.savepoint("sp_ok"))
val rel = _rejected_by_validator(tx.release_savepoint("sp_ok"))
tx.rollback()
assert_false(sp)
assert_false(rel)
```

</details>

